Hi guys,

I just installed ubuntu-server-9.10 as a virtualbox, then installed
the R 2.11.1 ubuntu binary from CRAN, and ran my ubuntu instructions
from the rapache manual, and I had success. The only difference I see
in my setup compared to yours, agb, is that the latest up to date
version of apache is 2.2.12 on ubuntu 9.10.

Maybe you and aL3xa can provide more details about your setups? Did
you compile and install any packages from source, besides rapache?

Jeff

